// seal Increment 4 — a seal inside a DEFER body: a region in cleanup code.
//
// This is the direction that had no C form at all before this increment: the
// walker for scopes with no defer chain of their own (defer bodies, diverging
// match arms) had no seal arm and reached codegen's ICE. The region needs a real
// chain of its own, since its own exit rides a defer.
fn f() {
    defer {
        println(3);
        seal { println(4); }   // the cleanup path needs indivisibility too
        println(5);
    }
    println(1);
    println(2);
}
fn main() { f(); println(6); }
